---
import { hasAnalytics, site } from "~/config/site";
import { operator } from "~/lib/legal";

const op = operator();
const { googleAnalyticsId, metaPixelId, tiktokPixelId } = site.analytics;
---

<p>
    Protecting your data matters to us. This policy explains what personal data we collect through
    <strong>{op.domain}</strong>, why we collect it, how long we keep it and what rights you have under Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).
</p>

<h2>1. Data controller</h2>
<p>
    The data controller is <strong>{op.name}</strong>{op.vatId && <>, VAT ID {op.vatId}</>}{op.registryNumber && <>, Trade Register no. {op.registryNumber}</>}{op.address && <>, registered at {op.address}</>}. For any data-related question, email us at <a href={`mailto:${op.email}`}>{op.email}</a>.
</p>

<h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> name, email, phone and company (optional), the services you are interested in and your message.</li>
    <li><strong>Email, phone or WhatsApp:</strong> whatever you choose to send us directly.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address and browser information, logged temporarily by our hosting provider for security and operation.</li>
    {hasAnalytics && <li><strong>Analytics and marketing data:</strong> only if you accept cookies, information about how you use the site (pages visited, visit length, device).</li>}
</ul>

<h2>3. Why we use it and on what basis</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr><th>Purpose</th><th>Legal basis</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>Replying to your message and sending you a quote</td><td>Steps prior to entering a contract (Art. 6(1)(b))</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Website security and spam prevention</td><td>Legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f))</td></tr>
        {hasAnalytics && <tr><td>Usage statistics and campaign measurement</td><td>Consent (Art. 6(1)(a))</td></tr>}
        <tr><td>Legal obligations (e.g. accounting, if you become a client)</td><td>Legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c))</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>4. How long we keep data</h2>
<p>
    Messages received through the form or by email are kept for at most 24 months after our last exchange, unless you become a client. If we sign a contract, data is kept for its duration and then as long as the law requires. Technical server data is deleted automatically after a short period.{hasAnalytics && <> Analytics data is kept for at most 14 months.</>}
</p>

<h2>5. Who we share data with</h2>
<p>We never sell your data. We only share it with providers that help us operate:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Vercel Inc.</strong> — website hosting;</li>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivering contact form messages;</li>
    {googleAnalyticsId && <li><strong>Google Ireland Ltd.</strong> — Google Analytics, only with your consent;</li>}
    {metaPixelId && <li><strong>Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd.</strong> — Meta Pixel, only with your consent;</li>}
    {tiktokPixelId && <li><strong>TikTok Technology Ltd.</strong> — TikTok Pixel, only with your consent;</li>}
</ul>
<p>
    Some providers may process data outside the European Economic Area. In those cases transfers rely on European Commission
    adequacy decisions (e.g. the EU-US Data Privacy Framework) or standard contractual clauses.
</p>

<h2>6. Cookies and local storage</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> we store your theme preference (light/dark) and your cookie choice in your browser. These do not identify you and do not require consent.</li>
    {hasAnalytics && <li><strong>Analytics and marketing:</strong> loaded only after you click “Accept” in the cookie banner. You can change your choice at any time via the “Cookie settings” link in the footer.</li>}
</ul>

<h2>7. Your rights</h2>
<p>You have the right to:</p>
<ul>
    <li>find out what data we hold about you and receive a copy (access);</li>
    <li>have inaccurate data corrected (rectification);</li>
    <li>have your data deleted (right to be forgotten);</li>
    <li>restrict or object to processing;</li>
    <li>receive your data in a portable format (portability);</li>
    <li>withdraw your consent at any time, without affecting earlier processing.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    To exercise any of these, email us at <a href={`mailto:${op.email}`}>{op.email}</a>. We reply within one month.
    You can also lodge a complaint with the Romanian data protection authority
    (<a href="https://www.dataprotection.ro" rel="noopener">ANSPDCP</a>) or the authority in your country.
</p>

<h2>8. Security</h2>
<p>
    The website uses encrypted connections (HTTPS) only. Access to data is limited to the people who need it to reply to you.
</p>

<h2>9. Changes</h2>
<p>
    We may update this policy when the way we process data changes. The date of the last update is shown above.
</p>
